## 6. Defects Identified

| Bug ID |   Module         |   Issue |                              Severity | Status |
|---|---------|--------------|------------------------------------------------|------|
| BUG-001 | Registration | Full Name has no maximum character validation | Medium | Open |
| BUG-002 | Registration | Invalid email accepted without error | Medium | Open |
| BUG-003 | Registration | Empty Location accepted | Medium | Open |
| BUG-004 | Registration | Location accepts 0 | Medium | Open |
| BUG-005 | Registration | Weak password accepted | High | Open |
| BUG-006 | Logout | Previous login input remains after logout | High | Open |

## 7. Overall Result

Testing identified several validation and logout-related issues
during execution. The identified defects were documented with
steps to reproduce, expected results, actual results and
supporting screenshots.

## 8. Recommendation

The identified defects should be fixed and the affected test
cases should be executed again during regression testing.

## 9. Conclusion

LifeLink was tested across its major user workflows. Functional,
UI, integration, API and database validation activities were
performed. Defects discovered during testing were documented and
will be retested after fixes are implemented.